  "description": "The new MVP pod kit from Innokin is the ideal kit for newer vapers thanks to a vaping experience that closely mimics that of taking a puff on a traditional cigarette. It’s also an incredibly lightweight and discreet solution for any vaper looking for an easy-to-carry and hassle-free vape. There’s only one fire button to play with on the Innokin MVP pod kit, but you can also operate the kit by taking a puff. When you’re done, a few clicks locks the device. USB-C charging means you can recharge the internal 500mAh battery in next to no time. A quick double-press selects between two different power modes: normal for a warm, smooth vape that helps conserve battery life, and Boost for a more intensely flavoured vape. The MVP kit uses refillable pods with an e-liquid capacity of 2ml and fixed 0.65 ohm coils that allow for multiple refills. When it is time to top up with e-liquid, simply release the silicon stopper and refill the pod with your favourite e-liquid. When your pod starts to lose flavour, simply swap it out for a new one. The MVP pod kit from Innokin is best used with nic salt , 50/50 and classic High-PG e-liquids.",
